# App domain of the stock Qualcomm eSIM LPA, which keeps its Fairphone
# signature. Stock runs it in vendor_qtelephony (Qualcomm sepolicy
# generic/private/seapp_contexts line 44, generic/product/private/seapp_contexts
# line 47); here it gets only what it uses. Public so that the vendor policy
# (telephony/) can bind its QCRIL service access to exactly this domain.
# eSIM LPA (com.qualcomm.qti.lpa).
type fp6_qti_lpa_app, domain;
